1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,080
I read somewhere that we're all a little weird, and life is a little weird too.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:10,140
And when we find someone whose weirdness is compatible with ours, we join up with them

3
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:15,280
and fall into mutually satisfying weirdness, and we call it love.
